From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: fogtape <lilixu3210@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 12:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] build: mobile Temporal Rust toolsets and libffi iOS callbacks

Separate native host tools from Android/iOS Rust archives and use libffi's
precompiled executable trampoline table for iOS callbacks. Full builds
retain ICU and enable Temporal; lite keeps its existing no-ICU policy.

Signed-off-by: fogtape <lilixu3210@gmail.com>
Assisted-by: Codex
---
 deps/crates/crates.gyp          | 215 +++++++++++++-------------------
 deps/libffi/generate-headers.py |  19 ++-
 deps/libffi/libffi.gyp          |  70 ++++++++---
 3 files changed, 153 insertions(+), 151 deletions(-)

